{"title": "Duergar Resilience", "pageid": 6053, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Duergar_Resilience", "categories": ["Bugs", "Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Duergar_Resilience.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Duergar_Resilience.webp/300px-Duergar_Resilience.webp, /w/images/9/93/Duergar_Resilience.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Duergar_Resilience.webp/300px-Duergar_Resilience.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Duergar_Resilience.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Duergar Resilience</b> is a passive feature available to all <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf#Duergar\" title=\"Dwarf\">Duergar</a> characters. It grants <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against illusions and against being <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charmed\">Charmed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Paralysed\">Paralysed</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>An affected creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Illusion\" title=\"Illusion\">Illusions</a> and against being <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aminah\" title=\"Aminah\">Aminah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anouk\" title=\"Anouk\">Anouk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Argram\" title=\"Argram\">Argram</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Belub\" title=\"Belub\">Belub</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bonna\" title=\"Bonna\">Bonna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brathwen\" title=\"Brathwen\">Brathwen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brithvar\" title=\"Brithvar\">Brithvar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dalthar\" title=\"Dalthar\">Dalthar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danna\" title=\"Danna\">Danna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drar\" title=\"Drar\">Drar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar_Spore_Servant_(guard_caster)\" title=\"Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)\">Duergar Spore Servant (guard caster)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dunnol\" title=\"Dunnol\">Dunnol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elenna_Thrinn\" title=\"Elenna Thrinn\">Elenna Thrinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fonmara\" title=\"Fonmara\">Fonmara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garmor\" title=\"Garmor\">Garmor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gergerann\" title=\"Gergerann\">Gergerann</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymon\" title=\"Greymon\">Greymon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grumm\" title=\"Grumm\">Grumm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grundril\" title=\"Grundril\">Grundril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Havkelaag\" title=\"Havkelaag\">Havkelaag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Holvik\" title=\"Holvik\">Holvik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hurk\" title=\"Hurk\">Hurk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jerris\" title=\"Jerris\">Jerris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kettel\" title=\"Kettel\">Kettel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kirgrath\" title=\"Kirgrath\">Kirgrath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\">Kith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kree_Derryck\" title=\"Kree Derryck\">Kree Derryck</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kur\" title=\"Kur\">Kur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lorlarrio\" title=\"Lorlarrio\">Lorlarrio</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lurgan\" title=\"Lurgan\">Lurgan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Magmar\" title=\"Magmar\">Magmar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mirthis\" title=\"Mirthis\">Mirthis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morghal\" title=\"Morghal\">Morghal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morgya\" title=\"Morgya\">Morgya</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Murmath\" title=\"Murmath\">Murmath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orgarth\" title=\"Orgarth\">Orgarth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pistle\" title=\"Pistle\">Pistle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Duergar\" title=\"Shattered Duergar\">Shattered Duergar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skarjall\" title=\"Skarjall\">Skarjall</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thudd\" title=\"Thudd\">Thudd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Torgga\" title=\"Torgga\">Torgga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Viss\" title=\"Viss\">Viss</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Only two spells in the entire game are affected by this passive's Advantage on Saving throws against Paralysed:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysing Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\">Paralysing Ray</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/20px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/30px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/40px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ocular Nightmare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/20px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\">Ocular Nightmare</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Illusion\" title=\"Illusion\">illusions</a> and being <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">charmed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">paralysed</a>.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200421\nCache ex